# Every route is prerendered to a flat file by scripts/prerender.mjs
# (dist/about.html, dist/locations/denver.html, ...), and Netlify
# serves those directly with a 200. No per-route rewrite is needed.
#
# The old `/*  /index.html  200` SPA fallback has been REMOVED on purpose:
# it returned a 200 copy of Home for every mistyped URL, which is a soft
# 404 and produced unlimited duplicate content.

